### VS Code "REST Client" ya da JetBrains HTTP Client ile çalıştırılabilir
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Kayıt
# @name kayit
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ilker@ornek.com", "name": "İlker", "password": "guclu-parola-123" }

###
@token = {{kayit.response.body.token}}

### Proje oluştur
# @name proje
POST {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Müşteri sitesi", "color": "#22c55e" }

### Görev ekle
POST {{base}}/projects/{{proje.response.body.id}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Ana sayfa tasarımı", "priority": 3, "due_date": "2026-10-10" }

### Yapılacaklar, önceliğe göre
GET {{base}}/tasks?status=todo&sort=-priority&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
